3708388805389404,"max_token_index":19,"peak_labels":{"hate speech":"none","language":"id","names":"none","part of speech":"NOUN","personal data":"none","postal addresses":"none","source":"fineweb-2","toxicity":"none"},"text":"BEKASI – Memiliki akses terhadap air bersih dan layak konsumsi merupakan hak seluruh masyarakat. Karena air bersih merupakan salah satu kebutuhan paling mendasar bagi kesehatan manusia.\nSelain untuk kebutuhan masyarakat sehari-hari, menurut World Health Organization (WHO), dengan meningkatkan pasokan air bersih serta pengelolaan sumber daya air yang lebih baik juga dapat meningkatkan pertumbuhan ekonomi suatu negara dan berkontribusi besar terhadap pengentasan kemiskinan.\nSelaras dengan visi memberikan peace of mind tak hanya ke pelanggan namun juga ke masyarakat sekitar, Asuransi Astra menyalurkan dana sosial peserta Asuransi Astra Syariah dengan membangun dan meresmikan sarana air bersih di Desa Muarabakti, Kecamatan Babelan, Bekasi pada 22 Maret 2024, bertepatan dengan Hari Air Sedunia.\nPeresmian sarana air bersih ini juga merupakan upaya Asuransi Astra dalam mendukung terwujudnya SDGs poin 6 “Air Bersih dan Sanitasi Layak” dalam menjamin ketersediaan serta pengelolaan air bersih dan sanitasi yang berkelanjutan untuk masyarakat.\nSelain mendukung perwujudan SDGs poin 6, pengupayaan dalam memberikan sarana air bersih ini juga berangkat dari fakta bahwa sebelumnya segenap warga Desa Muarabakti hanya bisa bergantung pada sumur dangkal dengan air bersih yang berjumlah terbatas untuk melengkapi kebutuhan sehari-hari.\nSehingga ketika musim kemarau panjang melanda, selain mengalami kesulitan dalam mendapatkan air bersih untuk diri sendiri dan keluarga, namun warga desa yang pada dasarnya merupakan penduduk yang berprofesi sebagai petani dan pedagang juga terdampak dengan kegagalan panen akibat kekeringan.\nDitambah saat musim kemarau, air cenderung keruh dan kuning serta berubah rasa. Hal ini tentunya juga tak hanya memberikan pengaruh buruk pada kesehatan, namun juga pada ekonomi warga sekitar akibat sumber pendapatan yang terhambat. Oleh karena itu, dalam upaya membantu memberikan sarana air bersih kepada warga Desa Muarabakti,\nAsuransi Astra melakukan pengeboran sumur sedalam 110 meter guna mencapai sumber air bersih dan penginstalasian mesin pompa air untuk memenuhi kebutuhan warga sekitar. Dengan air yang dihasilkan sebesar 5 m³ perjam, pompa air memompa air bersih yang kemudian berhasil ditampung di dalam tandon air.\n“Kami ucapkan terima kasih untuk Asuransi Astra atas bantuan peresmian penyediaan sarana air bersih kepada warga desa kami. Semoga sarana ini dapat digunakan sebaik mungkin oleh warga sekitar serta dapat membantu mereka dalam mendapatkan kemudahan untuk melengkapi kebutuhannya terutama pada hasil panen yang menjadi mata pencaharian agar dapat membantu meningkatkan ekonomi warga sekitar lebih baik lagi. Kami juga berharap dengan adanya air bersih dapat lebih mendukung lingkungan sekitar menjadi bersih dan sehat agar dapat terhindar dari berbagai macam penyakit,” kata Camat Babelan, H","tokens":["BE","K","AS","I"," –"," Mem","il","iki"," a","ks","es"," ter","had","ap"," air"," b","ers","ih"," dan"," lay","ak"," k","ons","ums","i"," mer","up","akan"," ha","k"," sel","ur","uh"," m","asy","arak","at","."," Karen","a"," air"," b","ers","ih"," mer","up","akan"," sal","ah"," sat","u"," ke","but","u","han"," p","aling"," m","endas","ar"," bag","i"," k","ese","hat","an"," man","us","ia",".","\n","Sel","ain"," unt","uk"," ke","but","u","han"," m","asy","arak","at"," se","h","ari","-","h","ari",","," men","ur","ut"," World"," Health"," Organization"," (","WHO","),"," deng","an"," mening","kat","kan"," pas","ok","an"," air"," b","ers","ih"," s","erta"," peng","el","ola","an"," sum","ber"," day","a"," air"," yang"," le","bi","h"," ba","ik"," jug","a"," d","apat"," mening","kat","kan"," pert","umb","u","han"," ek","onom","i"," su","atu"," neg","ara"," dan"," b","erk","ont","rib","usi"," bes","ar"," 